  "worked_solution": "The conditional statement $P\u21d2Q$ is logically equivalent to the disjunction $\u00acP\u2228Q:$\n\nSo, in this case, we have the following equivalence:\n\n$$\n\u00acA\u21d2B\u2261\u00ac(\u00acA)\u2228B\n$$\n\nCanceling out double negations, we reach\n\n$$\n\u00ac(\u00acA)\u2228B\u2261A\u2228B.\n$$\n\nSo the given statement is equivalent to $A\u2228B.$",
